{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "3f7686d4-a92f-80b9-a1e9-c534c724e6aa",
  "created_at": "2026-01-28T11:10:09-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Judith Thurston",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:03:32-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:03:35-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi Kevin, hon, it's Judith Thurston. I manage a property and I've got water coming through the yard again, and I need to figure out whose drain this even is."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:03:51-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, sure. Let me grab a pen. So water in the yard, and is this from the storm?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:04:01-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, from last weekend, that snow-to-rain thing, Sunday into Monday. All that snow melted with the rain on top and it just came down the hill. It's Wednesday and the yard is still a swamp."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:04:19-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that was a lot of water at once. So where's it coming from, exactly?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:04:27-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The next street up. There's a hill, and everything runs down it and straight into the yard. Doesn't go in a drain, doesn't go anywhere, it just comes right on in. Every time it rains hard it's the same thing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:04:47-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Water running down off the upper street into the yard. Is there a catch basin up there that looks blocked, or is there not one at all?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:05:02-05:00",
      "duration": 28,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There's one at the corner, I think, but it's packed with leaves and gunk, and honestly I don't know if it even does anything. Here's the thing, hon. I called about this before and somebody told me it's a state road. So it's not the city's problem. That was it, that was the whole answer."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:05:30-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Do you remember about when that was, or who you talked to?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:05:37-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, I don't remember a name. It was a while back. They said state road, sorry, can't help, and that was that. So I've been sitting here with a wet yard and nobody doing a thing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:05:56-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, I hear you. So what you're really asking is whether that drain is a city one or a state one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:06:07-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Exactly. City or state? Because if I keep getting told it's the other guy, nothing ever gets fixed. I'd like somebody to actually tell me and then write it down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:06:23-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fair enough. Some of the bigger roads in town are state-maintained, and the drains along them go with the road. But I can't tell you which it is without the exact spot. What's the street up top, and where's the property?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:06:44-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, I'd rather not get into the address on this call. I'm on my cell, and I'm kind of in and out of the house. Can you look it up from the street name without it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:07:03-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not really, I need a location to check the map. What I can do is put in a request for an engineer or a supervisor to look at it and call you back with the answer on who owns it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:07:23-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, but I want a real answer this time. Not a brush-off."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:07:30-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. I'll write it up as a drainage complaint, runoff from the upper street into the yard, ownership unclear, caller was told state road previously. Does that sound right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:07:45-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it. And put that it's happened more than once. It's not a one-time thing. I'm so tired of this."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:07:56-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Noted, recurring. And if it does turn out to be state, we can give you the right number to call, so you're not bounced around again."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:08:10-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That would actually be nice. Hang on, sorry, hon, I've got a houseguest staying with me and he is a very loud sleeper. I can hear him from the kitchen. He's snoring like a leaf blower and it's eleven in the morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:08:31-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ha, okay. Rough. Do you need to step away?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:08:36-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no, I'm fine, I'll go out on the porch. Anyway. How long till somebody calls me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:08:45-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Honestly, the crews are busy after that storm, so I'd say a few days. I'll mark it so they know it's a callback. What number do they use, the one you're on now?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:09:02-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, it's 401-555-0173."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:09:05-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zero-one-seven-three, got it. And that's under Thurston, T-H-U-R-S-T-O-N?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:09:10-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, that's right. Judith."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:09:13-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. In the meantime, if you can safely clear leaves off the drain at the corner, that can help a little, but don't go in the road to do it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:09:29-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I might, if it stops raining. But honestly it shouldn't be on me to do that either. If it's the city's drain, somebody should be cleaning it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:09:43-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that's fair, and that's what the review should sort out. If water starts coming into a building, call back right away and we'll bump it up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:09:57-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Well, thanks, Kevin. Please make sure somebody actually calls me this time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:10:04-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I will. Take care, Judith."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:10:07-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Bye, hon."
    }
  ],
